+|---:|---:|
+| 10 seq/s | 171 GPU-hours |
+| 20 seq/s | 85 GPU-hours |
+| 40 seq/s | 43 GPU-hours |
+| 80 seq/s | 21 GPU-hours |
+
+Record the P1 projection in:
+
+```text
+P0_00_COMPUTE_BUDGET.json
+```
+
+before authorizing P1.
