++
++## P0 calibration
++
++Use:
++
++```text
++3 independent training seeds
++```
++
++for the non-DP calibration arm.
++
++The representative DP arm follows the smoke-then-3-seed rule in §8.2.
++
++Seed IDs:
++
++```text
++101
++202
++303
++```
++
++Each seed changes:
++
++- parameter initialization where applicable;
++- mini-batch order;
++- DP noise;
++- canary inclusion decisions.
++
