+++
+++#### Planted null
+++
+++For every calibration/validation trial plant:
+++
+++- \(R_{\mathrm{priv}}\) independent of \(e\);
+++- no operator effect;
+++- no lineage effect;
+++- \(D_L=0\) in expectation;
+++- \(D_R=0\) in expectation;
+++- cell-level shared noise plus within-seed residual noise.
