+++```text
+++embeddings
+++LM head
+++vision tower
+++audio tower
+++multimodal projector
+++router/expert gating
+++PLE embeddings
+++```
+++
+++unless a later robustness experiment explicitly authorizes it.
+++
+++This target policy gives the cleanest common low-rank object across Qwen, Gemma, Mistral, and Llama.
