+++"gpu_smoke": {"status": "NON_EVIDENTIARY",
+++              "reason": "missing or malformed run_id",
+++              "observed": {"outcome": "PASS", "detail": "8 passed, 0 skipped in 3.1s",
+++                           "recorded_utc": "..."}}
+++```
