++++Do **not** give the reviewer the implementer's persuasive rationale.
++++
++++Permissions:
++++
++++```text
++++READ ONLY
++++NO EDIT
++++NO COMMIT
++++NO AUTO-FIX
++++```
++++
++++Verdict:
++++
++++```text
++++PASS
++++PASS_WITH_NONBLOCKING_NOTES
++++FAIL
++++```
