++++`env_id = ENVIRONMENT_LOCK_SHA256`. It is the value consumed as `RUN_ID`'s `environment lock
++++SHA256` input and as the environment component of the §7.1 cache key
++++[AUTH: 01 §12(5)–(9), §15, §16, §30, §32].
