++++yield different `ENVIRONMENT_LOCK_SHA256`, hence different `RUN_ID`s, so `artifacts/runs/<RUN_ID>/`
++++cannot collide across runtimes [AUTH: 01 §36], and a runtime/serving change forces a new
++++environment hash [AUTH: 01 §32].
