+++++## 6.2 OpenRouter
+++++
+++++OpenRouter is reserved for **scientific experimental use only**.
+++++
+++++It is not used for:
+++++
+++++```text
+++++code generation
+++++code review
+++++stage adjudication
+++++statistical interpretation
+++++selecting interesting results
+++++```
+++++
