++++++## 3.2 Hidden constituent
++++++
++++++Let the private task-specific constituent be represented by the induced LoRA update:
++++++
++++++\[
++++++\Delta W_A.
++++++\]
++++++
++++++The released constituent checkpoint itself is not available to the attacker.
