++++++
++++++The review system exists to remove high-impact mistakes, not to maximize comments.
++++++
++++++The desired terminal state is:
++++++
++++++```text
++++++few findings
++++++all concrete
++++++all traceable
++++++all closed
++++++no unresolved BLOCKER
++++++no unjustified scope
++++++```
