+++++++## Confirmatory expansion
+++++++
+++++++If P0 and P1 pass all gates, final confirmatory primary-model cells use:
+++++++
+++++++```text
+++++++5 total training seeds
+++++++```
+++++++
+++++++by adding:
+++++++
+++++++```text
+++++++404
+++++++505
+++++++```
