+++++++## P0-C3 — Open operator regimes
+++++++
+++++++After C1/C2/C2B are validated, the project may study:
+++++++
+++++++- DARE;
+++++++- later TIES;
+++++++- incomplete masks;
+++++++- more complex multi-parent conditions.
