+++++++## P0-C4 — O3 incomplete-lineage recovery, conditional
+++++++
+++++++Activate only if:
+++++++
+++++++```text
+++++++P1_PRIMARY_LOSSY_OPERATOR = SVD_TRUNC_MERGE
+++++++```
+++++++
+++++++For fixed known \(\alpha\):
+++++++
+++++++\[
+++++++C_i^{\mathrm{SVD}}-\theta_0
+++++++=
+++++++\alpha T_s(\tau_A)
++++++++
+++++++(1-\alpha)T_s(\tau_{B_i}).
+++++++\]
