+++++++
+++++++```text
+++++++LeakageError
+++++++```
+++++++
+++++++before metric computation.
+++++++
+++++++---
+++++++
+++++++### DRY-CACHE — content-addressed cache correctness
+++++++
+++++++Run two cache assertions.
+++++++
+++++++#### Stable hit
+++++++
+++++++With identical:
