+++++++### C-02 — No single-owner reservation for the fixed-FPR ROC estimator; 02 §C1/§C2 never carried
+++++++`FIX` — §1.1 now lists 02 §C1, §C2, §C4, §C5, §C8. New §13.1 fixes
