+++++++INSPECT DIFFS
+++++++NO PRODUCTION EDITS
+++++++NO COMMIT
+++++++```
+++++++
+++++++A Codex reviewer may create scratch diagnostics outside authoritative source paths only if those diagnostics are included in the review bundle.
