++++++++\]
++++++++
++++++++Alternative:
++++++++
++++++++\[
++++++++D_L\neq0.
++++++++\]
++++++++
++++++++The normalized \(G_L\) is a secondary cross-cell effect-size summary.
++++++++
++++++++No positive direction is presupposed.
++++++++
++++++++---
