+++++++++- continuous inferential analysis;
+++++++++- display-only thresholded frontiers;
+++++++++- pilot gates;
+++++++++- DARE utility gate;
+++++++++- deployment-realism scan;
+++++++++- conditions for expansion, redesign, or stopping.
