+++++++++Conservative per-artifact planning count:
+++++++++
+++++++++\[
+++++++++N_{\mathrm{seq/artifact}}=19{,}608.
+++++++++\]
+++++++++
+++++++++Where one forward pass supports multiple metrics, outputs must be cached and reused.
