++++++++++```
++++++++++
++++++++++### DRY-E — denominator instability
++++++++++
++++++++++Plant:
++++++++++
++++++++++\[
++++++++++M(A)-M_0
++++++++++\]
++++++++++
++++++++++near zero.
++++++++++
++++++++++Expected:
++++++++++
++++++++++```text
