++++++++++# SHA256 over the COMPLETE frozen execution environment: uv.lock, Docker image digest, CUDA
++++++++++# runtime and driver, torch version and CUDA build, Python version, GPU model
++++++++++# [AUTH: 01 §12(5)-(9), §15, §16, §30, §32; plan §5.6].
