++++++++++
++++++++++If **neither** canary nor natural oracle signal is eligible in the non-DP calibration arm:
++++++++++
++++++++++```text
++++++++++STOP_PRIVACY_GRID
++++++++++```
++++++++++
++++++++++Do not add operators, epsilons, datasets, or models.
++++++++++
