+++++++++++
+++++++++++`STAGE_PLAN.md` must be:
+++++++++++
+++++++++++```text
+++++++++++<= 1,200 lines
+++++++++++```
+++++++++++
+++++++++++If longer:
+++++++++++
+++++++++++```text
+++++++++++PLAN_TOO_LARGE
+++++++++++```
+++++++++++
+++++++++++and it must be reduced before review.
+++++++++++
+++++++++++A plan longer than 1,200 lines is treated as implementation disguised as planning.
+++++++++++
