+++++++++++**Round:** 2 of 2 — final [AUTH: 03 §12]
+++++++++++**Responds to:** `CLAUDE_BLIND_REVIEW.md` (verdict FAIL), `CODEX_BLIND_REVIEW.md` (verdict FAIL)
