+++++++++++
+++++++++++```text
+++++++++++0.004 <= aggregate realised FPR <= 0.016
+++++++++++|observed fixed-FPR TPR - analytic TPR| <= 0.08
+++++++++++STRONG selected in >= 4 of 5 outer folds
+++++++++++```
