+++++++++++
+++++++++++# Final locked interpretation
+++++++++++
+++++++++++No new scientific question is opened by these corrections.
+++++++++++
+++++++++++The primary endpoint remains:
+++++++++++
+++++++++++\[
+++++++++++\boxed{\mathrm{TPR}@1\%\mathrm{FPR}}
+++++++++++\]
+++++++++++
+++++++++++at a common held-out evaluation FPR.
+++++++++++
+++++++++++The corrections ensure that:
+++++++++++
+++++++++++- ties cannot create impossible ROC points;
+++++++++++- finite-sample fixed-FPR bias is measured;
+++++++++++- DRY-G controls family-wise false failure rather than marginal false failure;
+++++++++++- backend integration cannot be mistaken for completed synthetic-statistics validation;
+++++++++++- stale cache cannot survive a backend/code change.
