+++++++++++unresolved MAJOR   -> stage BLOCKED unless formally REJECTED with evidence
+++++++++++new MINOR/NOTE     -> deferred ticket
+++++++++++```
+++++++++++
+++++++++++Do not start Round 3 for non-BLOCKER findings.
+++++++++++
+++++++++++This prevents review recursion.
