++++++++++++## 3.6 Complete attacker observation
++++++++++++
++++++++++++The full lineage observation is:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++R=(C_{1:k},Z).
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
++++++++++++All L2 and L3 empirical capability definitions are relative to \(R\).
