++++++++++++
++++++++++++A recovery method:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++h\in\mathcal H
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
++++++++++++maps:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++R \rightarrow \hat A=h(R).
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
