++++++++++++## 28A.1 Stage-1 coarse target levels
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Use:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++e_target ∈ {
++++++++++++  0.01, 0.02, 0.05, 0.10, 0.15, 0.20, 0.30,
++++++++++++  0.40, 0.60, 0.80, 1.00, 1.50, 2.00
++++++++++++}
++++++++++++```
