++++++++++++
++++++++++++The hypotheses are deliberately null-safe.
++++++++++++
++++++++++++## H1 — Parameter-proxy validity
++++++++++++
++++++++++++> Privacy recovery is monotonically associated with parameter recovery quality.
++++++++++++
++++++++++++This is evaluated continuously.
