++++++++++++The current Llama 4 Scout base checkpoint is:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++17B active parameters
++++++++++++109B total parameters
++++++++++++16 experts
++++++++++++MoE
++++++++++++native multimodal
