++++++++++++
++++++++++++It is not used to define the main effect.
++++++++++++
++++++++++++If activated:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++BF16 weights
++++++++++++multi-H100 if required
++++++++++++text-only
++++++++++++no quantization
++++++++++++non-DP targeted replication only initially
++++++++++++separate MoE interpretation
++++++++++++```
