++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++authority documents
++++++++++++stage plan / implementation
++++++++++++diff
++++++++++++tests
++++++++++++raw outputs
++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Claude does not receive Codex findings.
