++++++++++++
++++++++++++Codex receives:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++authority documents
++++++++++++stage plan / implementation
++++++++++++diff
++++++++++++tests
++++++++++++raw outputs
++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
