++++++++++++(`stage_acceptance/S00/01_PLAN.md` §13).
++++++++++++
++++++++++++CLI
++++++++++++    python scripts/check_repo_invariants.py [--root PATH] [--json]
++++++++++++Exit
++++++++++++    0 = all invariants hold; 1 = at least one violation
++++++++++++Out
