++++++++++++## 24A.4 Selected fallback rank
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Choose the **smallest retained rank** \(s\) satisfying both:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++\Delta\mathrm{NLL}^{\mathrm{SVD}}_{s}\le0.05
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
++++++++++++and:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++e_{\mathrm{O3},s}\ge0.25.
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Call it:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++s^*.
++++++++++++\]
