++++++++++++
++++++++++++For descendant-direction vectors:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++D_i=\operatorname{vec}(C_i-B_i)
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
++++++++++++in conditions where \(B_i\) is known, form the direction matrix:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++\mathcal D
++++++++++++=
++++++++++++[D_1,\ldots,D_k].
++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Report relevant singular values.
