++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++artifact hash
++++++++++++record-set hash
++++++++++++tokenizer hash
++++++++++++score-code version
++++++++++++precision
++++++++++++max sequence length
++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
++++++++++++require:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++cache_key_1 == cache_key_2
++++++++++++cache_hit == TRUE
++++++++++++cached scalar scores are bitwise-identical
++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
++++++++++++#### Version invalidation
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Change only:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
