++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Require:
++++++++++++
++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++new_cache_key != old_cache_key
++++++++++++old cached entry is not returned under new key
++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
++++++++++++A cache implementation that fails either assertion cannot be used for P0.
