++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++NOTE
++++++++++++```
++++++++++++
++++++++++++No eloquent hypothetical may remain a BLOCKER/MAJOR.
++++++++++++
++++++++++++---
++++++++++++
++++++++++++# 6. Minimal-comment rule
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Reviewers must optimize for **signal, not volume**.
++++++++++++
++++++++++++Do not output:
