++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++praise
++++++++++++style preferences
++++++++++++renaming suggestions
++++++++++++optional refactors
++++++++++++generic best practices
++++++++++++duplicated findings
++++++++++++"consider..." comments with no concrete failure
