+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++```text
+++++++++++++Δe50 = COMPUTE_LIMITED_NOT_ESTIMATED
+++++++++++++```
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++This is distinct from `RIGHT_CENSORED`, which is reserved for an eligible curve that remains above the target level through calibrated support.
