+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++The study remains scientifically useful under the following outcomes.
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++## Outcome A
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++\[
+++++++++++++R_{\mathrm{priv}}
+++++++++++++\]
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++is a tight monotone function of parameter error.
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++Interpretation:
