+++++++++++++## P0-C2B.4 Intended contrasts
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++Primary \(k\) contrast:
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++```text
+++++++++++++C08  : k=2, beta spread ≈ 3.45
+++++++++++++C09M : k=4, beta spread ≈ 3.45
