+++++++++++++```text
+++++++++++++DENOMINATOR_UNSTABLE
+++++++++++++normalized cross-cell ranking disabled
+++++++++++++```
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++### DRY-F — beyond-calibration point
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++Plant an operator observation with:
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++\[
+++++++++++++e>2.0.
+++++++++++++\]
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++Mechanical assertion:
+++++++++++++
