+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++---
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++## Outcome F
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++\[
+++++++++++++D_R\approx0.
+++++++++++++\]
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++(and correspondingly \(G_R\) near zero in eligible cells).
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++Interpretation:
