+++++++++++++# 5. Final adjudicator
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++After:
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++```text
+++++++++++++Claude implementation
+++++++++++++Claude adversarial review
+++++++++++++required fixes
+++++++++++++re-tests
+++++++++++++Codex independent review where mandatory
+++++++++++++```
+++++++++++++
