+++++++++++++```text
+++++++++++++ACCEPT
+++++++++++++ACCEPT_WITH_NONBLOCKING_NOTES
+++++++++++++REJECT
+++++++++++++```
+++++++++++++
+++++++++++++No `REJECT` stage enters the protected experiment branch.
+++++++++++++
