++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++## 3.1 Base model
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++Let:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++\theta_0
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++denote the public base model.
