++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++## 3.4 Public descendants
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++The public release family is:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++C_{1:k}=(C_1,\ldots,C_k).
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++Each descendant contains the **same trained draw of \(A\)**.
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++The base training of \(A\) is not re-run for each descendant.
