++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++Let:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++Z
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++denote attacker-visible side information.
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++Depending on the condition, \(Z\) may contain:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++- \(\theta_0\);
++++++++++++++- merge family;
++++++++++++++- partner identities/checkpoints;
++++++++++++++- coefficients;
++++++++++++++- random masks;
++++++++++++++- other released metadata.
