++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++A recovery method:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++h\in\mathcal H
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++maps:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++R \rightarrow \hat A=h(R).
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++The induced recovered update is:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++\widehat{\Delta W}_A.
++++++++++++++\]
