++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++P0/P1 use:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++\[
++++++++++++++k\in\{1,2,4\}.
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++The value:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++++k = 8
++++++++++++++```
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++is deferred.
