++++++++++++++```
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++under the planted null.
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++The analysis stack must therefore demonstrate both:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++```text
++++++++++++++TRUE EFFECT -> DETECTABLE
++++++++++++++NULL EFFECT -> NOT MANUFACTURED
++++++++++++++```
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++before real outcomes are opened.
