++++++++++++++=
++++++++++++++\{1.857,\ 1.222,\ 0.818,\ 0.538\},
++++++++++++++\qquad
++++++++++++++\rho_\beta\approx3.45.
++++++++++++++\]
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++Thus the analytic beta spread is matched to the \(k=2\) condition while descendant count changes.
