++++++++++++++The canonical controller must perform, inside every outer fold:
++++++++++++++
++++++++++++++1. fold construction;
++++++++++++++2. calibration-only candidate selection;
++++++++++++++3. calibration-only threshold estimation;
++++++++++++++4. held-out fold scoring;
