+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++For each of the 3 calibration seeds, evaluate the oracle \(A_s\).
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++Measure:
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++- canary TPR@1%FPR;
+++++++++++++++- natural-record TPR@1%FPR;
+++++++++++++++- bootstrap CIs.
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++---
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++## 28.1 Canary gate
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++Canary privacy measurement is considered powered if the aggregate across seeds satisfies the eligibility rule in §18.
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++---
+++++++++++++++
