+++++++++++++++\]
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++Mechanical assertion:
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++```text
+++++++++++++++result_label == UNDEFINED_BEYOND_CALIBRATION
+++++++++++++++```
+++++++++++++++
+++++++++++++++and no extrapolated residual is created.
