+++++++++++++++| Scope / process | `UNJUSTIFIED_SCOPE`, `PROMPT_ONLY_REQUIREMENT`, `PLAN_TOO_LARGE`, `REVIEW_PROCESS_FAIL` | 03 §4, §7, §13, §14, §15 | Used at S00 review |
+++++++++++++++
