++++++++```text
++++++++bf16_fp32_tolerance                     measured on the image over fixed sequences
++++++++nondeterminism_sources, run-to-run tolerance                              01 §30
++++++++batch size, throughput q, peak VRAM, projected GPU-hours   S10 benchmark, 00 §0.2.4
++++++++```
